let __v_164 = Value::from("Change the sheets once a week, and more often in hot weather, if you sweat at night or if a pet sleeps on the bed; pillowcases twice a week on the same count. Wash at 60C to kill dust mites, or 40C with a good detergent if the colours matter more, and dry them properly before they go back on. Two sets so one is on while the other washes makes it easy to keep up.");
