let __v_366 = Value::from("Clear the surfaces, then work clockwise so you do not double back: hot soapy water on the surfaces and the sink, the hob while it is still warm, and the floor last so the crumbs you drop land on it. Daily is a wipe round, weekly is the hob and the sink, monthly is the oven and the inside of the fridge. Where grease has built up, hot water with a good squeeze of washing-up liquid lifts it and cold water only smears it, and a paste of bicarbonate on a cloth takes the film off tiles, the splashback and the top of the cupboards. Most of the work is not letting things dry on, because a wipe while the pan is still warm beats an hour of scrubbing.");
