let __v_3049 = Value::from("A hot barbecue mostly cleans itself: leave it on full for fifteen minutes, then brush the warm grate with a stiff wire brush and a half onion or potato held in tongs. Anything baked on lifts after an hour under a paste of bicarbonate of soda and water. Wipe the ash out when it is cold, and oil the grate with a little vegetable oil on kitchen paper.");
